{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567910/extras/1000001896.gif?t=1743697413\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to <strong>HostageHub</strong>, the ultimate hostage-rescue-gig-economy experience! Your objective is simple: eliminate the baddies, rescue the hostage, earn cash, and repeat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Co-op Action</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Friendship is forged in the flames of hostage rescue. Team up with up to 5 other players to bring the hostages home (or, if you have no friends, you can go it solo, we won't judge).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you fight slowly and calculated, or go in guns blazing? A bit of both may be required to take on your adversaries. But hey, just remember the number one rule of hostage rescue - have fun!<strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Wave-based Gameplay</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The more hostages you rescue, the more powerful your enemies get. And the more money you earn for upgrades. Funny how that works, huh?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Earn to Progress</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your earnings to purchase an arsenal of weapons, gear, and power-ups to keep you one step ahead of the baddies.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Strategic Budgeting</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Guns and ammo ain't cheap! Balancing your budget is crucial to your survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567910/extras/1000001897.gif?t=1743697413\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>HostageHub\u00a0</strong>is calling on<i> you</i>\u00a0to bring the boys back home \u2013 will you rise to the challenge?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2567910?t=1743697413","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567910/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743697413","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567910/da96f36bcedefa15c0ee734eb55925ad2f6c8f85/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743697413","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567910/da96f36bcedefa15c0ee734eb55925ad2f6c8f85/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743697413","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567910/extras/1000001896.gif?t=1743697413\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to <strong>HostageHub</strong>, the ultimate hostage-rescue-gig-economy experience! Your objective is simple: eliminate the baddies, rescue the hostage, earn cash, and repeat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Co-op Action</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Friendship is forged in the flames of hostage rescue. Team up with up to 5 other players to bring the hostages home (or, if you have no friends, you can go it solo, we won't judge).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you fight slowly and calculated, or go in guns blazing? A bit of both may be required to take on your adversaries. But hey, just remember the number one rule of hostage rescue - have fun!<strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Wave-based Gameplay</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The more hostages you rescue, the more powerful your enemies get. And the more money you earn for upgrades. Funny how that works, huh?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Earn to Progress</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your earnings to purchase an arsenal of weapons, gear, and power-ups to keep you one step ahead of the baddies.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Strategic Budgeting</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Guns and ammo ain't cheap! Balancing your budget is crucial to your survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567910/extras/1000001897.gif?t=1743697413\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>HostageHub\u00a0</strong>is calling on<i> you</i>\u00a0to bring the boys back home \u2013 will you rise to the challenge?</p>","developers":["BeefWave"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567910/header.jpg?t=1743697413","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i3 / AMD Ryzen 3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 10 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated Graphics<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul